@SmartCoachService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5107
@token = REPLACE_WITH_JWT

### 7.1 Send chat message (new session)
POST {{SmartCoachService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/smart-coach/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What should I eat before a leg day workout?"
}

### 7.1 Send chat message (existing session)
POST {{SmartCoachService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/smart-coach/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "And after the workout?",
  "sessionId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### 7.2 Get chat history for a session
GET {{SmartCoachService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/smart-coach/history?sessionId=11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111&page=1&pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7.2 Get caller's chat sessions
GET {{SmartCoachService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/smart-coach/history?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7.3 Get home feed
GET {{SmartCoachService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/home
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
